# Gremlin Tamer, Eerie: a Room is an enchantment, so Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber cast as its left door entering makes a
# Gremlin (CR 603.2), and unlocking its right door "fully unlocks a Room" (CR 709.5i) for a second one - 1/1 red Gremlin tokens
# (CR 111.4), alongside the Demon the right door's own trigger makes. Setup follows
# nykthos-counts-both-doors-of-a-room-once-both-are-unlocked.

